通用属性，全局可用：.shadow(value: ShadowOptions | ShadowStyle)；API 18 起另有 .shadow(options: Optional<ShadowOptions | ShadowStyle>)
ShadowOptions { radius: number | Resource; type?: ShadowType; color?: Color | string | Resource | ColoringStrategy; offsetX?: number | Resource; offsetY?: number | Resource; fill?: boolean }
ShadowType { COLOR, BLUR }；ShadowStyle { OUTER_DEFAULT_XS, OUTER_DEFAULT_SM, OUTER_DEFAULT_MD, OUTER_DEFAULT_LG, OUTER_FLOATING_SM, OUTER_FLOATING_MD }

List(options?: ListOptions) { ListItem() { … } }：全局组件；.divider(value: ListDividerOptions | null)
ListDividerOptions { strokeWidth: Length; color?: ResourceColor; startMargin?: Length; endMargin?: Length }
Divider()：.strokeWidth(value: number | string)、.color(value: ResourceColor)、.vertical(value: boolean)、.lineCap(value: LineCapStyle)

Toggle(options: ToggleOptions)，ToggleOptions { type: ToggleType; isOn?: boolean }：全局组件；ToggleType { Checkbox, Switch, Button }
.selectedColor(value: ResourceColor)、.switchPointColor(color: ResourceColor)、.onChange(callback: (isOn: boolean) => void)
通用属性 .hitTestBehavior(value: HitTestMode)；HitTestMode { Default, Block, Transparent, None, BLOCK_HIERARCHY, BLOCK_DESCENDANTS }（后两个 API 20 起）

Tabs() { TabContent() { … }.tabBar(SubTabBarStyle.of('<标签>')) }：Tabs、TabContent 全局组件，SubTabBarStyle 全局类（static of(content: ResourceStr) 与 new SubTabBarStyle(content) 均可）
SubTabBarStyle：.labelStyle(value: LabelStyle)、.indicator(value: IndicatorStyle)、.selectedMode(value: SelectedMode)、.board(value: BoardStyle)
LabelStyle { overflow?; maxLines?; minFontSize?; maxFontSize?; heightAdaptivePolicy?; font?: Font; selectedColor?: ResourceColor; unselectedColor?: ResourceColor }
IndicatorStyle { color?: ResourceColor; height?: Length; width?: Length; borderRadius?: Length; marginTop?: Length }
